001500*                                                              *  SQ1024.2
001600*      X-CARDS USED BY THIS PROGRAM ARE :-                     *  SQ1024.2
001700*                                                              *  SQ1024.2
001800*            X-01   SEQUENTIAL MAGNETIC TAPE                   *  SQ1024.2
001900*            X-55   SYSTEM PRINTER                             *  SQ1024.2
