050700 SECT-SQ104-0001 SECTION.                                         SQ1044.2
050800 SEQ-INIT-WR-01.                                                  SQ1044.2
050900     MOVE    "SQ-FS3" TO XFILE-NAME (1).                          SQ1044.2
051000     MOVE    "R1-F-G" TO XRECORD-NAME (1).                        SQ1044.2
