055000                TO FILE-RECORD-INFO-P1-120 (2).                   SQ1044.2
055100     MOVE    ZERO   TO XRECORD-NUMBER (2).                        SQ1044.2
055200     GO TO   SEQ-TEST-GF-02-02.                                   SQ1044.2
055300 SEQ-DELETE-02-02.                                                SQ1044.2
