057100     GO TO   SEQ-TEST-GF-01.                                      SQ1064.2
057200 SEQ-DELETE-01.                                                   SQ1064.2
057300     MOVE   "*" TO DELETE-SW-1.                                   SQ1064.2
057400     GO TO   SEQ-DELETE-01-01.                                    SQ1064.2
