065700     MOVE "READ SHORT RECORD" TO FEATURE.                         SQ1074.2
065800     MOVE "SEQ-INFO-004" TO PAR-NAME.                             SQ1074.2
065900     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        SQ1074.2
