045100     IF COUNT-OF-RECS GREATER THAN 550                            SQ1164.2
045200         MOVE "MORE THAN 550 RECORDS" TO RE-MARK                  SQ1164.2
045300         GO TO SEQ-FAIL-024.                                      SQ1164.2
