045700        GO TO SEQ-FAIL-024-1.                                     SQ1164.2
045800     IF NUMBER-AREA NOT EQUAL TO COUNT-OF-RECS                    SQ1164.2
045900        GO TO SEQ-FAIL-024-1.                                     SQ1164.2
