035200 END-RTN-EXIT.                                                    SQ1214.2
035300     MOVE CCVS-E-1 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   SQ1214.2
035400 END-ROUTINE-1.                                                   SQ1214.2
