039400     PERFORM WRT-LN.                                              SQ1214.2
039500 WRT-LN.                                                          SQ1214.2
039600     WRITE    DUMMY-RECORD AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.               SQ1214.2
039700     MOVE SPACE TO DUMMY-RECORD.                                  SQ1214.2
039800 BLANK-LINE-PRINT.                                                SQ1214.2
