045100 SEQ-INIT-014.                                                    SQ1214.2
045200     MOVE ZERO TO COUNT-OF-RECORDS.                               SQ1214.2
045300*        THIS TEST READS AND CHECKS THE FILE CREATED              SQ1214.2
045400*    IN SEQ-TEST-013.                                             SQ1214.2
