118500                   TO RE-MARK                                     SQ1244.2
118600         MOVE   "VII-3, VII-38,4.2.4(4)" TO ANSI-REFERENCE        SQ1244.2
118700         PERFORM FAIL.                                            SQ1244.2
118800 SEQ-TEST-11-01-END.                                              SQ1244.2
