044500     MOVE    SPACE TO COMPUTED-X.                                 SQ1254.2
044600     MOVE    SPACE TO CORRECT-X.                                  SQ1254.2
044700     IF REC-CT EQUAL TO ZERO  MOVE SPACE TO PAR-NAME.             SQ1254.2
044800     MOVE    SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                    SQ1254.2
044900*                                                                 SQ1254.2
