001400*     THIS ROUTINE CHECKS THE SAME AS SQ104 IN COMBINATION        SQ1274.2
001500*     WITH                                                        SQ1274.2
001600*                                                                 SQ1274.2
001700*         SELECT ... ASSIGN TO   "LITERAL-1"                      SQ1274.2
