031300 INSPT. MOVE "INSPT" TO P-OR-F. ADD 1 TO INSPECT-COUNTER.         SQ1274.2
031400 PASS.  MOVE "PASS " TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO PASS-COUNTER.           SQ1274.2
031500 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          SQ1274.2
