042200     WRITE SQ-FS3R1-F-G-120.                                      SQ1274.2
042300     IF XRECORD-NUMBER (1) EQUAL TO 649                           SQ1274.2
042400        GO TO SEQ-WRITE-007.                                      SQ1274.2
