037600     MOVE TEST-COMPUTED TO PRINT-REC PERFORM WRITE-LINE           SQ1284.2
037700     MOVE TEST-CORRECT TO PRINT-REC PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   SQ1284.2
037800 FAIL-ROUTINE-EX. EXIT.                                           SQ1284.2
