029200 PASS-DECL.                                                       SQ1354.2
029300     MOVE   "PASS " TO P-OR-F.                                    SQ1354.2
029400     ADD     1 TO PASS-COUNTER.                                   SQ1354.2
029500     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL-DECL.                                   SQ1354.2
