002500*                                                              *  SQ1414.2
002600*    SPLIT FROM SQ129A, THIS PROGRAM REPEATS THE SEQUENCE OF   *  SQ1414.2
002700*    FILE HANDLING ROUTINES IN ORDER TO CARRY OUT THE ISOLATED *  SQ1414.2
