037700     MOVE    CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD.                            SQ1464.2
037800     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          SQ1464.2
037900     IF INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                             SQ1464.2
