044900*        FIRST IT SETS UP A SKELETON RECORD IN WORKING STORAGE.   SQ1464.2
045000*                                                                 SQ1464.2
045100     MOVE "SQ-FS1"     TO XFILE-NAME (1).                         SQ1464.2
