045200     ADD     ERROR-COUNTER   TO ERROR-HOLD                        SQ1534.2
045300     ADD     INSPECT-COUNTER TO ERROR-HOLD.                       SQ1534.2
045400     ADD     DELETE-COUNTER  TO ERROR-HOLD.                       SQ1534.2
