030400  END-ROUTINE-12.                                                 SQ2014.2
030500      MOVE "TEST(S) FAILED" TO ENDER-DESC.                        SQ2014.2
030600     IF       ERROR-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                      SQ2014.2
