030800         ELSE                                                     SQ2014.2
030900         MOVE ERROR-COUNTER TO ERROR-TOTAL.                       SQ2014.2
031000     MOVE     CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD.                           SQ2014.2
031100     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          SQ2014.2
031200 END-ROUTINE-13.                                                  SQ2014.2
