050700     MOVE WRK-XN-00001-KEY-2 TO COMPUTED-A.                       SQ2034.2
050800     MOVE "1" TO CORRECT-A.                                       SQ2034.2
050900     CLOSE SQ-FS2.                                                SQ2034.2
