033900     MOVE CCVS-E-3 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           SQ2094.2
034000 WRITE-LINE.                                                      SQ2094.2
034100     ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT.                                       SQ2094.2
