039700*             OPERATION WITH AN EOP PHRASE. ONLY LINAGE IS        SQ2094.2
039800*             SPECIFIED.                                          SQ2094.2
039900     MOVE "WRITE BEFORE" TO FEATURE.                              SQ2094.2
