045100     IF XRECORD-NUMBER (1) EQUAL 1000                             SQ2134.2
045200              GO TO OPEN-TEST-GF-01-05.                           SQ2134.2
045300     ADD 1 TO XRECORD-NUMBER (1).                                 SQ2134.2
045400     GO TO OPEN-TEST-01-04.                                       SQ2134.2
