052400*         THEN IT IS READ AND VALIDATED FOR CORRECTNESS.          SQ2134.2
052500     MOVE "SQ-FS2" TO XFILE-NAME (2).                             SQ2134.2
052600     MOVE "R1-F-G" TO XRECORD-NAME (2).                           SQ2134.2
052700     MOVE "SQ213"  TO XPROGRAM-NAME (2).                          SQ2134.2
