032300 PASS.  MOVE "PASS " TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO PASS-COUNTER.           SQ2144.2
032400 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          SQ2144.2
