037100         MOVE DELETE-CNT TO ERROR-TOTAL.                          SQ2144.2
037200     MOVE "TEST(S) DELETED     " TO ENDER-DESC.                   SQ2144.2
037300     MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           SQ2144.2
