001400*                                                              *  SQ2154.2
001500*      X-CARDS USED BY THIS PROGRAM ARE :-                     *  SQ2154.2
001600*                                                              *  SQ2154.2
001700*            X-14   SEQUENTIAL MASS STORAGE                    *  SQ2154.2
