000400****************************************************************  SQ2164.2
000500*                                                              *  SQ2164.2
000600*    VALIDATION FOR:-                                          *  SQ2164.2
000700*    "ON-SITE VALIDATION, NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF STD & TECH.     ".SQ2164.2
000800*                                                              *  SQ2164.2
