001000*    "COBOL 85 VERSION 4.2, Apr  1993 SSVG                      ".SQ2184.2
001100*                                                              *  SQ2184.2
001200*       THIS ROUTINE CHECKS  THE                                  SQ2184.2
001300*               RECORD DELIMITER IS STANDARD-1    CLAUSE.         SQ2184.2
