057400     MOVE    SPACE TO DUMMY-RECORD.                               SQ2254.2
057500 BLANK-LINE-PRINT.                                                SQ2254.2
057600     PERFORM WRT-LN.                                              SQ2254.2
057700 FAIL-ROUTINE.                                                    SQ2254.2
