002400*                                                              *  SQ2304.2
002500*    THIS PROGRAM CHECKS FOR THE CORRECT RESPONSE TO READING   *  SQ2304.2
002600*    A FILE OPEN IN THE EXTEND MODE.  THE TEST FOR CORRECT I-O *  SQ2304.2
002700*    STATUS CODE 47 IS IN THE MAIN LINE CODE, THEREFORE AN     *  SQ2304.2
002800*    ABNORMAL TERMINATION IS POSSIBLE BEFORE THE TEST OF THE   *  SQ2304.2
002900*    I-O STATUS CODE IS ACCOMPLISHED.                          *  SQ2304.2
003000*                                                              *  SQ2304.2
003100****************************************************************  SQ2304.2
